              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Double-handed sword and large shield. May have javelins (+1 pt), light armour (+2 pts). Subject to Warband rule 1. (Armies of Antiquity p.19)</characteristic>
